>>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FX-NORM.
AUTHOR. SMCPE.
REMARKS. FX normalization — validates S9(5)V9(4), locks per run, status 00/01.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-RATE      PIC S9(5)V9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 WS-RATE-DISP PIC ZZZZ9.9999.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-FX-RATE-STR PIC X(15).
01 LS-OUT-RATE PIC X(15).
01 LS-STATUS PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-FX-RATE-STR LS-OUT-RATE LS-STATUS.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-STATUS
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(LS-FX-RATE-STR) = SPACES
        MOVE "01" TO LS-STATUS
        MOVE "0.0000" TO LS-OUT-RATE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-RATE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(LS-FX-RATE-STR)
        ON SIZE ERROR MOVE "01" TO LS-STATUS MOVE "0.0000" TO LS-OUT-RATE GOBACK END-COMPUTE
    IF WS-RATE <= 0 OR WS-RATE > 99999.9999
        MOVE "01" TO LS-STATUS
        MOVE "0.0000" TO LS-OUT-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-RATE TO WS-RATE-DISP
        MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-RATE-DISP) TO LS-OUT-RATE
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
